{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14303355","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14303355","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1430335501:1":{"text":"うん、あの恵の霊水の真相、今はもう秘密じゃなくなったからね。","source_cn":"因为他被赶走的原因终于不是秘密了！莱恩被贵族赶走的原因...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93357B7F02BC3658","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430335502:1":{"text":"実は竜の卵の卵白で、たくさん飲むと鱗が出るらしいよ……","source_cn":"我听说恩典灵露就是龙蛋清，喝多了身体会产生龙化……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1E4F30B638619A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1430335503:1":{"text":"そうなの！ルアンが見たのは、貴族の顔の「真実」だったってわけ！","source_cn":"没错！莱恩被赶走就是因为他看见贵族面纱下的鳞片！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD3D608CA5662D05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:平民玛瑟琳":{"text":"平民のマーセリン","source":"平民玛瑟琳","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:平民伊多":{"text":"平民のイド","source":"平民伊多","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}